# Keep the build context small and deterministic. Anything copied in that is not
# needed both slows the build and invalidates the layer cache for no reason.

**/bin/
**/obj/
**/out/
**/TestResults/
**/coverage/
**/logs/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/

.git/
.github/
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/

# Local databases and logs must never be baked into an image.
**/*.db
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal
**/*.log

# Real environment files stay out; .env.example is harmless but unused here.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

**/.DS_Store
docs/
README.md
LICENSE
